{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["לא כן אבי — 'I did not do so, but the firstborn I brought to your right and the younger to your left.' Yaakov said to him: I know, my son, I know, that you are wise, and you brought them in order according to my right and my left, because you think I will place my right hand on the firstborn — but I intend to place my right hand on the younger, who is at your right."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:47:33.825033246Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}